  abstract={<P>This chapter contains sections titled: <UL> <LI> <P>Introductory Notes</P> </LI> <LI> <P>Fuzzy C-Means as an Optimization Environment for the Design of Information Granules</P> </LI> <LI> <P>Dynamic Formation of Fuzzy Clusters��-��Splitting and Merging Mechanisms</P> </LI> <LI> <P>Characterization of Structural Dynamics of the Families of Clusters</P> </LI> <LI> <P>Experimental Studies</P> </LI> <LI> <P>Conclusion</P> </LI> <LI> <P>Acknowledgments</P> </LI> <LI> <P>References</P> </LI> </UL> </P>},
